# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PRIVATE — never publish. This repository is intended to go public.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Agent + assistant configuration
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
.cursor/
.aider*

# Strategy, planning, and competitive analysis. Never published.
#
#   private/ROADMAP.md          kill criteria, funding applications, ship dates,
#                               acquisition sequencing
#   private/RESEARCH.md         competitor teardowns, thesis-falsification tests
#   private/PRD.md              success metrics, probability estimates
#   private/MARKETING.md        target vendors, outreach tiers, positioning
#   private/CONTENT-CALENDAR.md posting plan + disclosure email templates
#
# Two of these are actively self-harming if published. Kill criteria tell an
# acquirer your reservation price and tell users you might walk away. Competitor
# teardowns burn a partnership before you have opened it.
private/
docs/private/

# Scan artifacts — never commit scan output of third-party servers.
# Per-server findings are subject to the disclosure policy in SECURITY.md.
*.sarif
scan-results/
census/raw/
census/findings/

# Disclosure correspondence and anything naming an unfixed vendor finding
disclosures/
*.disclosure.md

